abstract: >-
  A research prototype biological dual-use content classifier built using
  Anthropic's Constitutional Classifiers methodology. Defines a 56-rule
  biosafety constitution across 7 NSABB categories, generates synthetic
  training and corrective augmentation data, and fine-tunes DeBERTa-v3-base
  for binary safe/unsafe classification. The v4 response-diverse checkpoint
  is the recommended release checkpoint after a leakage audit and v5 non-release
  decision; it reaches 2.1% FPR on OR-Bench-Hard-1K, 0% XSTest FPR, 32%
  WildGuard native bio recall, and 0.45 BioThreat-Eval F1. Intended as a
  research artifact, not a production safeguard.
